= Adam Próchnik

Próchnik belongs to the cast of the continuation (from January 1928 in chapter 2). He represents Lewica PPS and combines republican socialism with openness to discussions with the KPP.

His actions are recorded for chapter 2 (Z — 0.29, M17); in this chapter he cannot be appointed.

